00:18:14.770 --> 00:18:18.250
Taka-kun. We'll continue this later, okay?

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:23.170
Please explain that you mean
we'll continue the conversation later.

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:27.390
Later... right?

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:36.390
This idea came about due to the friendship among the two presidents, right?

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:37.860
Not exactly.

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:38.690
Oh?

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:40.940
We are friends,

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:43.320
and also rivals.

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:45.190
In love?!

00:18:45.590 --> 00:18:51.140
I take interest in NTR,
so I think it'll be fine even if I lose.

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:52.310
I see.

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:54.670
<i>Careless words there. So careless.</i>

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:12.120
<i>I wonder how the president is doing.</i>

00:19:14.990 --> 00:19:17.850
Are you worried about Shinocchi?

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:20.150
Well, yeah...

00:19:20.150 --> 00:19:20.850
It's fine.

00:19:21.740 --> 00:19:25.530
Our student council is filled with excellent members as well.

00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:28.110
They'll follow her down to the word.

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:30.990
Is that so?

00:19:30.990 --> 00:19:32.960
We have a tsukkomi (straight man) role!

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:34.120
So there is one.

00:19:34.490 --> 00:19:35.370
There    is one

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:41.660
The way I conduct myself will be connected to the reputation of Ousai.

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:45.000
As its representative, I should focus myself!

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:46.450
Slap! Slap!

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:51.360
Wait a minute. It'll be indecent if there are any leftover marks on my cheeks.

00:19:53.030 --> 00:19:56.260
Amakusa-san, sorry to keep you waiting!

00:19:57.450 --> 00:19:57.930
Huh?!

00:19:58.520 --> 00:19:59.770
Slap

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:06.900
I'm a second year in the Eiryou student council
and the vice president. My name is Mori.

00:20:07.280 --> 00:20:10.230
We are in your care for this one day today.

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:15.070
Same here. I am in your care.

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:19.760
It's just as the rumors say.
I can surmise the merit of your upbringing.

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:23.350
And I can feel that merit of upbringing
in you guys as well.

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:24.920
Is that so?

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:30.420
Let's go ahead and begin our work right away.

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:31.370
All right.

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:32.170
Whoa!

00:20:36.520 --> 00:20:38.990
Oh, no! My erasers are all used up.

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:41.930
If you're fine with it, use mine.

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:44.150
You're quite prepared.

00:20:44.150 --> 00:20:47.320
I always bring two in case this happens.

00:20:47.650 --> 00:20:51.590
I also carry around two thermometers with me.

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:52.200
Huh?

00:20:52.570 --> 00:20:55.470
If I stick them in both armpits,
it makes my boobs look big.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:59.700
This never occurred with President Uomi...

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:07.570
I see that Eiryou's okay with dating.

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:10.840
If it's platonic dating, it gets implicit consent.

00:21:10.840 --> 00:21:13.550
Ousai explicitly prohibits this,

00:21:13.550 --> 00:21:15.970
but it might already be outdated.

00:21:16.610 --> 00:21:20.830
We were persuaded by our vice president before, you see.

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:27.640
That what's needed at the top is the power to flexibly take in the changes of the times.

00:21:29.110 --> 00:21:31.980
That's right. Rather than a hard-headed person...

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:33.640
A soft turtle head!

00:21:34.590 --> 00:21:37.680
And sensitivity that's like nipples!

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:39.870
Please rephrase that.

00:21:39.870 --> 00:21:43.870
So, we should not be caught in fixed ideas,

00:21:43.870 --> 00:21:47.880
But we should instead look at things
from different perspectives.

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:51.460
So the principal here says good things as well!

00:21:51.460 --> 00:21:54.130
I should try looking at things from a different perspective right away.

00:21:54.880 --> 00:21:57.290
At a glance she's just grasping her knees while sitting...

00:21:59.650 --> 00:22:02.700
Yet from this one position,
various sex positions can ensue.

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:04.340
Rephrase that!

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:05.850
<i>She's suddenly speaking bluntly.</i>

00:22:12.420 --> 00:22:15.070
Have you seen President Amakusa?

00:22:15.440 --> 00:22:18.700
The president said she was going to the roof.

00:22:30.010 --> 00:22:33.710
I wonder how everyone's doing now.

00:22:39.860 --> 00:22:42.920
She seems lonely due to
being in a different environment...

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:46.850
There has to be something fun to talk about.

00:22:47.230 --> 00:22:48.900
President Amakusa!

00:22:50.830 --> 00:22:55.190
What kind of person is the Ousai vice-president
you were talking before?

00:22:55.790 --> 00:22:58.420
I'd like to meet him once as well.

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:01.250
Is that so?

00:23:01.250 --> 00:23:04.030
Huh? She's pouting for some reason...

00:23:04.030 --> 00:23:05.040
No!

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:06.010
Huh?!

00:23:06.010 --> 00:23:07.270
I won't let you meet him!

00:23:07.270 --> 00:23:09.120
What?! Why?!

00:24:43.970 --> 00:24:46.260
So yeah, I was thinking that but...

00:25:11.950 --> 00:25:14.420
Oh Shinocchi, you get lonely so easily.

00:25:15.960 --> 00:25:17.270
Did you do it right?

00:25:17.840 --> 00:25:19.500
Well of course I did!
